{
  "schema_version": "0.0.1",
  "id": "kick-muted",
  "name": "Muted Kick",
  "category": "modular",
  "notes": "kickMutedSeed: MUTED: fitted to a muted/pillowed kick (AKT-KCK-A018_bip): a\nfelt beater (no slap, no skin) and the Air (vacuum) noise that makes a\nrecorded kick only ~47% tonal. Without it the same kick read \"digital\"\n(88-92% tonal).",
